1
00:00:02,180 --> 00:00:03,580
没错 亲爱的 米奇尔帮我
Yeah, honey, Mitchell helped me

2
00:00:03,580 --> 00:00:05,302
挑的衬衫 你会喜欢的
pick up the shirt. You're gonna love it.

3
00:00:06,260 --> 00:00:07,740
我也希望能帮你买唇膏
Oh, I wish I could pick you up some lip gloss

4
00:00:07,740 --> 00:00:09,393
但我们已经在车里了
but we are already at the car.

5
00:00:09,860 --> 00:00:10,900
好吧 再见 亲爱的
Okay, bye, honey.

6
00:00:11,700 --> 00:00:12,940
弹得不错吧
Getting pretty good, huh?

7
00:00:13,040 --> 00:00:14,840
是啊 你一向很厉害
Yeah, but you were always good.

8
00:00:15,180 --> 00:00:16,800
我很高兴你坚持学下来了
I'm just glad you stuck with it.

9
00:00:17,240 --> 00:00:17,660
你认真的吗
Seriously?

10
00:00:18,420 --> 00:00:18,860
怎么了
What?

11
00:00:19,500 --> 00:00:20,660
这琴自己在弹
It's playing itself.

12
00:00:22,040 --> 00:00:22,700
我又不知道
I didn't know.

13
00:00:22,840 --> 00:00:26,740
你真的以为我突然成了钢琴大师吗 爸
You honestly thought that I just became a piano virtuoso, dad?

14
00:00:26,751 --> 00:00:28,040
你看着我从小长到大
You knew my whole life.

15
00:00:28,040 --> 00:00:29,360
你看过我学琴了吗
Have you ever seen me take a lesson?

16
00:00:29,360 --> 00:00:31,040
我以为你自学了呢
I thought maybe you were self-taught.

17
00:00:31,314 --> 00:00:32,140
抱歉 你说得对
Oh, I'm sorry. You're right.

18
00:00:32,140 --> 00:00:34,120
-就像我自学单簧管一样 -没错
- Like when I taught myself to play the clarinet. - Exactly.

19
00:00:34,240 --> 00:00:35,840
我从没吹过单簧管
I never played the clarinet.

20
00:00:36,060 --> 00:00:37,040
能别说了吗
Can we drop it?

21
00:00:37,320 --> 00:00:38,500
我们去吃个冰淇淋吧
Let's go get an ice cream.

22
00:00:38,920 --> 00:00:40,340
考虑过我乳糖不耐受吗
What about my lactose intolerance?

23
00:00:40,340 --> 00:00:41,682
我不太喜欢这样纠缠下去
Oh, I'm not loving this game.

24
00:00:43,700 --> 00:00:44,420
太糟糕了
This sucks.

25
00:00:44,480 --> 00:00:46,100
我老师给了我单核细胞增多症
My teacher gave me mononucleosis.

26
00:00:46,840 --> 00:00:48,880
作为父母 我觉得我有必要问清楚
As a parent, I feel I should ask about this.

27
00:00:49,020 --> 00:00:51,200
别去阻止 她想吸引男人也不容易
Slow down. It's not like she gets that many tugs on the line.

28
00:00:51,200 --> 00:00:52,480
是生物课作业
It's for A.P. Bio.

29
00:00:52,480 --> 00:00:53,860
我们得写关于一种疾病的报告
We have to write a report about a disease,

30
00:00:53,860 --> 00:00:55,940
我拿到了最糟糕的题目 简直开玩笑
and I got the worst one. This is a joke.

31
00:00:56,000 --> 00:00:57,100
其实那种病很严重
Actually, it's pretty serious.

32
00:00:57,100 --> 00:00:58,340
上大学时 我从我室友林那里
Back in college, I caught mono

33
00:00:58,340 --> 00:00:59,260
感染了单细胞增多症
from my roommate, Ling.

34
00:00:59,960 --> 00:01:01,300
是我们鬼混应得的报应
Served us right for fooling around.

35
00:01:02,100 --> 00:01:03,320
不要跟别人同吹一根长笛 孩子们
Never share a flute, kids.

36
00:01:04,520 --> 00:01:05,820
你能载我到图书馆吗
Hey, can you drop me off at the library?

37
00:01:06,120 --> 00:01:08,420
抱歉 我要去湖边的咖啡馆见朋友
Sorry. I'm meeting some friends at that coffee shop on lake.

38
00:01:08,580 --> 00:01:09,960
你是说图书馆旁边那家吗
You mean the one next to the library?

39
00:01:10,220 --> 00:01:11,300
那是图书馆吗
That's a library?

40
00:01:11,360 --> 00:01:12,180
我还以为那是某个
I thought it was a church

41
00:01:12,180 --> 00:01:13,840
不允许化妆的宗教的教堂呢
for a religion that didn't allow makeup.

42
00:01:14,100 --> 00:01:15,860
洗衣机什么时候才能修好啊
When is the washing machine gonna get fixed?

43
00:01:16,020 --> 00:01:17,800
我裤子底下穿着泳裤呢
I'm wearing a swimsuit underneath my pants.

44
00:01:18,880 --> 00:01:20,340
大家很快就能穿上干净的衣服了
Everybody's gonna have clean clothes soon.

45
00:01:20,360 --> 00:01:21,740
修理工应该今天早上十点
The repair guy's supposed to come today

46
00:01:21,750 --> 00:01:22,840
到下午两点间过来
between 10:00 and 2:00.

47
00:01:22,840 --> 00:01:24,200
亲爱的 你能在家里等他吗
Oh! Honey, can you be here for that?

48
00:01:24,280 --> 00:01:26,520
我能坐在空荡荡的房子里等人吗
Can I sit around in an empty house and wait for someone?

49
00:01:26,520 --> 00:01:27,980
亲爱的 我可是房产经纪人
Baby, I'm a realtor.

50
00:01:28,460 --> 00:01:29,560
有执照的 专门干这种事
I have a license for that.

51
00:01:29,720 --> 00:01:30,660
你确定你不介意吗
You sure you don't mind?

52
00:01:30,740 --> 00:01:31,620
去吧 忙你的吧
Go. Run your errands.

53
00:01:31,640 --> 00:01:33,200
这样我正好可以开始洗这些盘子了
It'll give me a chance to get started on these dishes.

54
00:01:33,200 --> 00:01:35,026
很好 走吧 卢克
Oh, good. All right, come on, Luke.

55
00:01:35,080 --> 00:01:36,580
好 晚点见
All right. See you guys later.

56
00:01:39,340 --> 00:01:41,340
盘子比我想象的多啊
Oh. More dishes than I thought.

57
00:01:41,620 --> 00:01:43,500
那个千层面盘子一定很难洗
That lasagna's gonna be a tough one.

58
00:01:44,760 --> 00:01:46,460
有人需要一把硬毛刷了
Somebody's gonna need a scrub brush.

59
00:01:49,640 --> 00:01:50,040
你好
Hello?

60
00:01:51,820 --> 00:01:52,220
什么
What?

61
00:01:55,420 --> 00:01:56,620
不...是吧
No...way!

62
00:01:57,760 --> 00:01:59,360
1988年6月10日
June 10, 1988.

63
00:01:59,690 --> 00:02:01,920
卡拉·康坎农和我在公共泳池里
Carla Concannon and I spent the afternoon

64
00:02:01,920 --> 00:02:03,440
玩了一下午
frolicking at the public pool.

65
00:02:04,000 --> 00:02:06,620
后来在她家里 我们开始做羞羞的事
Later, at her house, things got private

66
00:02:07,360 --> 00:02:09,340
那时还放着卡莉·西蒙的
while a 45 of Carly Simon's

67
00:02:09,340 --> 00:02:10,700
《没人做得更好》的45转黑胶
"Nobody does it better" played.

68
00:02:11,240 --> 00:02:14,120
那是我第一次 也是她第一次...
It was my first time, her first time...

69
00:02:15,100 --> 00:02:15,840
跟我做那事儿
with me.

70
00:02:16,300 --> 00:02:18,700
我一直想要拥有那张45转黑胶唱片
I always thought it'd be fun to own that 45.

71
00:02:19,020 --> 00:02:21,080
当那天早上唱片店终于给我打来电话
When the record store finally called that morning,

72
00:02:21,080 --> 00:02:23,560
我立马跑了过去 以免错过修理工
I ran right down so I wouldn't miss the repairman.

73
00:02:23,660 --> 00:02:25,140
我必须拥有那张唱片
I had to have it.

74
00:02:25,448 --> 00:02:26,980
这是我重温
It was the chance to relive

75
00:02:26,980 --> 00:02:30,020
那神奇的3分42秒的机会
those magical 3 minutes and 42 seconds,

76
00:02:30,020 --> 00:02:31,840
这也正是那首歌的长度
which was also the length of the song.

77
00:02:32,060 --> 00:02:33,720
但我突然间想到
But then it dawned on me --

78
00:02:33,720 --> 00:02:35,580
我心想着那些
I was cheating on my wife

79
00:02:35,580 --> 00:02:38,140
跟别的女人的热烈回忆是对我老婆不忠
with the red-hot memory of another woman.

80
00:02:42,020 --> 00:02:44,220
我不能让克莱尔发现
I could not let Claire find out.

81
00:02:45,000 --> 00:02:46,880
我得销毁证据
I had to destroy the evidence.

82
00:02:47,940 --> 00:02:50,080
还好 我在重压之下依然冷静
Luckily, I'm cool under pressure.

83
00:02:59,940 --> 00:03:01,520
什么 不
What?! No!

84
00:03:02,160 --> 00:03:03,080
他什么时候
When did he...?

85
00:03:03,660 --> 00:03:04,520
不是吧
Come on!

86
00:03:05,100 --> 00:03:06,440
尽管障碍重重
There were a couple of snags,

87
00:03:06,880 --> 00:03:09,780
但我觉得我隐藏得很不错
but I think I covered my tracks pretty well.

88
00:03:24,280 --> 00:03:26,780
很抱歉这么久才把这些衣服拿给你
I'm so sorry it took so long to get you these clothes.

89
00:03:26,960 --> 00:03:27,940
我把它们落在车后座了
I left them in the back of my car

90
00:03:27,940 --> 00:03:29,440
而且完全忘了
and completely forgot about them.

91
00:03:29,740 --> 00:03:30,660
听着好耳熟
Sounds familiar.

92
00:03:30,660 --> 00:03:32,560
我才进药店三分钟
I was in the pharmacy for three minutes.

93
00:03:32,560 --> 00:03:34,000
车窗开了一道缝 还给你留了果汁
You had a cracked window and a juice box.

94
00:03:34,120 --> 00:03:35,220
别再说那件事了
Let's retire that story.

95
00:03:35,460 --> 00:03:37,160
我能穿这件拍全家福吗
Can I wear this for the family photo?

96
00:03:37,380 --> 00:03:38,940
亲爱的 这件衣服很可爱 但是
Oh, honey, that's adorable, but, you know,

97
00:03:38,960 --> 00:03:40,800
歌洛莉亚要我们穿牛仔裤配黑T恤
Gloria wants us in jeans and a black T-shirt --

98
00:03:40,800 --> 00:03:42,300
经典又随性
Classic and casual.

99
00:03:42,300 --> 00:03:43,880
也许拍完照后 我们可以顺便
And then maybe afterwards, we can stop by

100
00:03:43,880 --> 00:03:45,300
去帮高中话剧表演换布景
and change the scenery in a high-school play.

101
00:03:45,520 --> 00:03:47,280
这条裙子真的很可爱
That is a really cute dress.

102
00:03:47,600 --> 00:03:49,380
是啊 谢谢 昨天刚买的
Oh, yeah, thank you. Just got it yesterday.

103
00:03:49,380 --> 00:03:49,920
真的吗
Really?

104
00:03:50,540 --> 00:03:52,540
让我想起了我六个月前给你的东西
It reminds me of something I gave you six months ago.

105
00:03:52,560 --> 00:03:54,640
你让她穿过二手衣服吗
Do you ever put her in the girls' hand-me-downs?

106
00:03:54,700 --> 00:03:56,320
-有啊 一直都有 -真的吗
- Oh, yeah. All the time. - Really?

107
00:03:56,540 --> 00:03:59,600
因为如果你不喜欢我女儿们的衣服
Because if my girls' old clothes aren't to your taste,

108
00:03:59,600 --> 00:04:01,780
我也可以...给别人啊
I could always just... give them to somebody else!

109
00:04:01,780 --> 00:04:02,940
冷静点 克莱尔
Okay, calm down, Claire.

110
00:04:02,980 --> 00:04:05,080
你的声音高得都快吵到我家的猫了
Your voice is getting to that pitch that disturbs our cat.

111
00:04:07,720 --> 00:04:08,760
我的天呐
Oh, my God.

112
00:04:08,800 --> 00:04:10,620
你们肯定不敢相信老爸说了什么
You will not believe what dad just said.

113
00:04:10,840 --> 00:04:12,240
我们在商场里
So, we're at the mall, right?

114
00:04:12,240 --> 00:04:14,360
那里有架钢琴 我坐在旁边的椅子上
And there's a piano there. I sit down behind it.

115
00:04:14,360 --> 00:04:15,440
-我开始 -拜托 米奇尔
- I start... - Come on, Mitchell.

116
00:04:15,440 --> 00:04:17,320
他就是不太会表扬人
He's just not wired for compliments.

117
00:04:17,320 --> 00:04:18,926
我相信你一定弹得很好
I'm sure your playing was great.

118
00:04:18,960 --> 00:04:21,500
我根本不会弹钢琴 我从来没学过
I don't play the piano. I've never taken a lesson.

119
00:04:21,740 --> 00:04:23,080
-你确定吗 -天呐
- Are you sure? - Oh, my god.

120
00:04:23,100 --> 00:04:24,280
我自己的家人都不了解我
My own family doesn't even know me.

121
00:04:24,300 --> 00:04:25,700
米奇尔 拜托 别这么敏感
Mitchell, please. Don't be so sensitive.

122
00:04:25,780 --> 00:04:27,100
你看我都没有因为
You don't see me pitching a fit

123
00:04:27,100 --> 00:04:28,920
小卡这么势利不愿接受我们的
because Cam is too much of a snob

124
00:04:28,930 --> 00:04:30,216
二手衣服而生气发火
to use our hand-me-downs.

125
00:04:30,216 --> 00:04:32,103
势 抱歉 势利
Sn-- I'm sorry -- snob?

126
00:04:32,480 --> 00:04:35,520
我告诉你 我来自质朴的农村家庭
I will have you know I come from simple farm folk.

127
00:04:35,820 --> 00:04:37,820
手指甲里永远有在土地里
There is permanent dirt underneath

128
00:04:37,820 --> 00:04:39,920
劳作时留下的泥土
these fingernails from working the soil.

129
00:04:39,920 --> 00:04:40,400
真的吗
Really?

130
00:04:40,400 --> 00:04:42,468
我还不知道给兰花换盆
I had no idea that re-potting your orchids

131
00:04:42,468 --> 00:04:44,090
也算是在土地里劳作呢
counted as "Working the soil."

132
00:04:44,090 --> 00:04:45,440
兰花是种在土里的
Okay, they're in soil, are--

133
00:04:45,440 --> 00:04:47,480
知道吗 我不想讨论这事了
You know what? I don't want to talk about this.

134
00:04:47,780 --> 00:04:48,460
我没必要听这些
I don't need to listen to this.

135
00:04:48,540 --> 00:04:49,460
我要出去透透气
I'm gonna go out and get some air.

136
00:04:49,800 --> 00:04:50,880
我知道那种感觉
I know the feeling.

137
00:04:51,120 --> 00:04:52,500
别再提了 真的
Retire it. Seriously.

138
00:04:55,020 --> 00:04:56,820
你看乔是不是有点脸色苍白
Does Joe look a little pale to you?

139
00:04:57,080 --> 00:04:58,660
这个国家的人在我看来都脸色苍白
This whole country looks pale to me.

140
00:04:58,780 --> 00:04:59,320
今晚就要拍照了
I think he needs

141
00:04:59,320 --> 00:05:01,020
我觉得他脸上应该多点颜色
a little color for tonight's photograph.

142
00:05:01,460 --> 00:05:04,240
你觉得使用美黑喷雾的最小年龄是多大
What do you think is the minimum age for a spray tanning?

143
00:05:04,760 --> 00:05:06,080
既然乔出生了
Now that Joe is here

144
00:05:06,080 --> 00:05:08,620
他的头也终于是正常大小了
and that his head is finally normal-shaped,

145
00:05:08,660 --> 00:05:10,980
我决定照一张新的全家福
I decided to take a new family portrait.

146
00:05:12,640 --> 00:05:13,040
好啊
Hola!

147
00:05:13,040 --> 00:05:14,900
购物怎么样
How did it go at the mall?

148
00:05:15,260 --> 00:05:16,780
买了一件衬衫 惹怒了我儿子
Bought a shirt, angered my son --

149
00:05:17,040 --> 00:05:18,260
又是一次成功的外出
another successful outing.

150
00:05:18,940 --> 00:05:20,380
我一直想这样做
Ooh. I've been wanting to do this.

151
00:05:20,520 --> 00:05:22,600
快回答 天使头上那个环是什么
Quick -- what's the ring around an angel's head?

152
00:05:22,660 --> 00:05:23,880
-什么 -好啊[光环]
- What? - Halo!

153
00:05:24,380 --> 00:05:25,900
你说了天使那个梗
You did the angel one!

154
00:05:26,260 --> 00:05:27,340
一般情况下我会很高兴
Ordinarily, I'd be delighted,

155
00:05:27,360 --> 00:05:29,020
但这次聊天不会有趣了
but this isn't gonna be one of our fun chats.

156
00:05:29,020 --> 00:05:30,520
你是说像你看见小型飞船时
You mean like that time you called me

157
00:05:30,520 --> 00:05:31,420
给我打电话的那次吗
when you saw that blimp?

158
00:05:31,680 --> 00:05:33,060
它飞得好低 上面的人都冲我挥手了呢
It was so low, they waved back.

159
00:05:33,560 --> 00:05:34,780
我做得很好
I'd done a pretty good job

160
00:05:34,780 --> 00:05:36,600
清除了那张唱片的一切痕迹
eliminating all traces of that record,

161
00:05:36,600 --> 00:05:38,900
但是还有一个问题
but there was still one loose end.

162
00:05:50,640 --> 00:05:51,840
今天早些时候
You know, earlier today,

163
00:05:51,860 --> 00:05:53,480
我们在街上碰见了
when we ran into each other on the street?

164
00:05:53,480 --> 00:05:54,800
我没看见你 你也没看见我
I didn't see you. You didn't see me.

165
00:05:55,400 --> 00:05:56,600
你这是说
Okay, so you're saying

166
00:05:56,600 --> 00:05:58,600
不管我们中的一个在干什么
whatever either one of us might have been doing

167
00:05:58,600 --> 00:05:59,560
这将永远...
will remain forever --

168
00:05:59,680 --> 00:06:02,280
我没看见你 你也没看见我
I didn't see you. You didn't see me.

169
00:06:02,544 --> 00:06:04,254
说清... 喂
Just to be c-- hello?

170
00:06:05,160 --> 00:06:07,500
杰真酷 他明白
Jay's so cool. He gets it.

171
00:06:07,900 --> 00:06:09,160
我不知道他在说些什么
I didn't know what he was talking about,

172
00:06:09,160 --> 00:06:11,000
但我得让他闭嘴
but I needed him to keep his trap shut.

173
00:06:12,260 --> 00:06:14,400
最近 我可能在忙活
You see, lately, I may have been dabbling

174
00:06:14,400 --> 00:06:18,740
像我这样强壮的爷们儿
in something that... strong, virile men like me

175
00:06:18,740 --> 00:06:20,440
不该忙活的事
aren't supposed to be dabbling in.

176
00:06:20,920 --> 00:06:22,940
这不符合我的形象
And it wouldn't exactly fit my image

177
00:06:22,940 --> 00:06:25,260
如果人们发现我打算
if people found out I was considering entering...

178
00:06:25,260 --> 00:06:29,620
带一只可爱的小狗参加狗展
a certain adorable dog in a dog show.

179
00:06:30,480 --> 00:06:32,800
歌洛莉亚觉得我是出去轮换车胎了
Gloria thought I was out getting my tires rotated.

180
00:06:32,940 --> 00:06:36,200
其实 我是在给斯黛拉买装饰领结
Actually, I was buying Stella a decorative show collar --

181
00:06:36,340 --> 00:06:38,460
以防万一嘛
you know, just in case.

182
00:06:39,260 --> 00:06:40,840
我想着如果她看起来很漂亮
I figure if she looks beautiful,

183
00:06:40,840 --> 00:06:41,780
就会更自信
she'll feel beautiful.

184
00:06:45,500 --> 00:06:47,040
猜猜我们在图书馆碰上了谁
Guess who we ran into at the library.

185
00:06:47,160 --> 00:06:48,500
我怎么知道 我一直都在这里
How would I know? I was here the whole time.

186
00:06:48,660 --> 00:06:50,360
桑杰·帕特尔 他拿到了克罗恩氏病
Sanjay Patel. He's got Crohn's disease.

187
00:06:50,580 --> 00:06:51,860
-不是吧 -就是啊 太走运了
- No! - I know. So lucky.

188
00:06:51,920 --> 00:06:53,380
他绝对会获得科学奖学金的
He's totally going to win that science scholarship.

189
00:06:53,700 --> 00:06:55,380
他该用这笔钱来治秃头
He should use it to find a cure for baldness,

190
00:06:55,380 --> 00:06:57,609
因为他都16岁了 还用梳发盖秃头
'cause that kid is 16 with a comb-over.

191
00:06:58,220 --> 00:06:58,820
就这样
That's it!

192
00:06:59,178 --> 00:07:00,546
我得选个新主题
I'm just gonna pick a new topic.

193
00:07:00,620 --> 00:07:02,400
我要一种学校里所有人
I want a disease that everyone in the school

194
00:07:02,400 --> 00:07:03,240
都会讨论的疾病
is going to talk about.

195
00:07:03,380 --> 00:07:04,200
好吧
All right!

196
00:07:07,320 --> 00:07:08,180
你站在这里干什么
Why are you standing there?

197
00:07:08,180 --> 00:07:09,427
因为我好想你 我好爱你
'Cause I missed you. I love you so much.

198
00:07:10,140 --> 00:07:12,880
我也爱你
Oh, wow. Love you, too.

199
00:07:13,180 --> 00:07:14,560
修理工修得怎么样了
How'd it go with the repair guy?

200
00:07:14,880 --> 00:07:17,080
修理工来了 但我错过了他
The repair guy came, but I missed him.

201
00:07:17,100 --> 00:07:18,280
"为什么 你在干什么"
"Why? What were you doing?"

202
00:07:18,520 --> 00:07:19,580
"听唱片"
"Listening to a record."

203
00:07:19,660 --> 00:07:21,320
"什么唱片" "不重要"
"What record?" "It's not important."

204
00:07:21,480 --> 00:07:21,900
"菲尔"
"Phil!"

205
00:07:22,280 --> 00:07:24,340
"我第一次滚床单时的背景音乐
"The soundtrack to my first sexual experience

206
00:07:24,340 --> 00:07:25,860
我时不时就会想起那个经历
that I think about from time to time.

207
00:07:26,040 --> 00:07:28,400
亲爱的 你要去哪 别带走孩子们"
Honey, where are you going?! Don't take the kids!"

208
00:07:29,440 --> 00:07:30,440
他没来
He didn't show up.

209
00:07:30,760 --> 00:07:32,920
什么 太过分了
What?! That is so annoying!

210
00:07:32,920 --> 00:07:33,980
就是啊 放下你的杂物
I know. Put away your groceries.

211
00:07:33,980 --> 00:07:34,860
我打电话给他重新安排
I'll call him and reschedule.

212
00:07:35,040 --> 00:07:36,820
不行 你太善良了
No, no, no, no, no. You are too nice.

213
00:07:36,900 --> 00:07:38,080
我去打电话
I am calling.

214
00:07:38,080 --> 00:07:39,880
不弄清真相我绝不善罢甘休
I am not resting till I get to the bottom of this.

215
00:07:39,880 --> 00:07:40,502
没什么大不了的
It's no big deal.

216
00:07:40,560 --> 00:07:42,360
这又不是我第一次被男人放鸽子了
It's not the first time I've been stood up by some guy.

217
00:07:42,440 --> 00:07:43,660
听听你自己在说什么 菲尔
Oh, listen to your words, Phil.

218
00:07:46,074 --> 00:07:48,519
是啊 是啊
Yep. Yep.

219
00:07:49,980 --> 00:07:52,720
她说我是势利眼 米奇尔
She called me a snob, Mitchell.

220
00:07:52,720 --> 00:07:54,864
真抱歉 我没有热心地把莉莉
I'm -- oh, I'm sorry if I don't rush

221
00:07:54,864 --> 00:07:57,340
塞进克莱尔扔给我们的
to throw Lily in every bargain-bin rag

222
00:07:57,340 --> 00:07:58,600
廉价衣服里
Claire tosses our way.

223
00:07:58,760 --> 00:08:01,160
你这样说还是很势利眼啊
You're not really shedding the "Snob" tag with that.

224
00:08:01,220 --> 00:08:02,760
为了今晚的拍照
Look, why don't we just put Lily

225
00:08:02,760 --> 00:08:04,400
不如我们让莉莉穿上艾丽克斯的衬衫吧
in one of Alex's shirts for the picture tonight?

226
00:08:04,440 --> 00:08:05,460
她会看穿的
She'll see right through that.

227
00:08:05,460 --> 00:08:06,640
不 你想的是海莉的衬衫
No, you're thinking of Haley's shirts.

228
00:08:06,640 --> 00:08:08,240
不 我是说我们这样做看起来
No, I mean it'll look ke we're doing it

229
00:08:08,240 --> 00:08:09,520
就像是因为她提到了这事
just because she brought it up.

230
00:08:09,640 --> 00:08:11,600
我知道 所以我在找一张莉莉穿着
Well, I know. That's why I'm looking for a photo

231
00:08:11,600 --> 00:08:13,760
别人的旧衣服的照片给卡莱尔看
of Lily in a hand-me-down to show Claire,

232
00:08:13,890 --> 00:08:15,240
但我好像找不到
but I-I can't seem to find one.

233
00:08:15,240 --> 00:08:17,480
顺便说一句 这些照片里基本都没我
By the way, I'm barely in any of these.

234
00:08:17,680 --> 00:08:19,700
米奇尔 你的建议是我想的那样吗
Mitchell, are you suggesting what I think you're suggesting?

235
00:08:19,860 --> 00:08:22,280
是啊 有时我觉得我们家不关注...
Yes! Sometimes I feel like this family looks right past --

236
00:08:22,280 --> 00:08:24,420
你在建议我们筹划拍一组照片
You're suggesting that we stage a photograph.

237
00:08:24,660 --> 00:08:25,940
给莉莉穿上旧衣服
Put Lily in some hand-me-downs.

238
00:08:25,960 --> 00:08:27,340
让照片看起来像是以前照的
Make it look like it's from the past --

239
00:08:27,800 --> 00:08:29,620
比如说圣诞节 来证明克莱尔错了
Christmas, say -- just to prove Claire wrong.

240
00:08:30,660 --> 00:08:31,460
简单易行
Simplicity itself.

241
00:08:31,780 --> 00:08:33,020
那根本不是我的意思...
That's not remotely what I'm saying --

242
00:08:33,020 --> 00:08:34,320
米奇尔 不要怀疑自己了
Mitchell, don't second-guess yourself.

243
00:08:34,580 --> 00:08:35,860
这简单易行
It's simplicity itself.

244
00:08:39,020 --> 00:08:41,740
是啊 再说一次 我想和主管谈谈
Yes, once again, I would like to speak to a supervisor.

245
00:08:42,080 --> 00:08:45,020
如果我丈夫说没人来 那就是没人来
Listen, if my husband said nobody came, nobody came.

246
00:08:45,180 --> 00:08:46,100
爸爸 该你走了
Dad, it's your move.

247
00:08:46,200 --> 00:08:47,780
不 我想我现在应该保持冷静
No, I think I should just play it cool for now.

248
00:08:48,720 --> 00:08:49,500
对不起
I'm so sorry.

249
00:08:50,560 --> 00:08:50,960
搞定了
Score!

250
00:08:51,080 --> 00:08:52,880
我找到了一个既稀有又有趣的疾病
I got a disease that's rare and fun

251
00:08:52,920 --> 00:08:53,520
嗜睡症
-- narcolepsy.

252
00:08:53,598 --> 00:08:56,980
公司发誓说司机十点来过这里
The company swears that the driver was here at 10:00.

253
00:08:56,980 --> 00:08:58,280
他们在叫司机接我电话
They're putting him through to me right now.

254
00:08:58,280 --> 00:08:59,600
我要驳倒他的说法
I'm gonna chip away at his story.

255
00:09:00,060 --> 00:09:01,600
看看你怎么脱身吧
Let's see how you get out of this.

256
00:09:01,600 --> 00:09:02,180
我在思考啊
I'm thinking.

257
00:09:02,560 --> 00:09:03,820
这是一种精神病
It's a neurological condition

258
00:09:03,820 --> 00:09:06,280
病人会在极端压力下睡着
where people under extreme stress actually fall asleep.

259
00:09:06,380 --> 00:09:07,660
就像大脑的一种逃脱方式
It's like a way for the brain to escape.

260
00:09:07,860 --> 00:09:09,960
我打赌他做了什么不该做的事情
I bet he was doing something he shouldn't have.

261
00:09:10,020 --> 00:09:12,500
我就让他一直说到露出破绽为止
I'm just gonna let him keep talking till he makes a mistake.

262
00:09:12,840 --> 00:09:13,960
每个人都会犯错
Everybody makes mistakes.

263
00:09:14,087 --> 00:09:15,640
套索收紧
And the noose tightens.

264
00:09:15,640 --> 00:09:17,260
我的耳机怎么跑到沙发上去了
Why were my headphones in the couch?

265
00:09:17,540 --> 00:09:20,280
很好 你们留有所有司机的定位记录
Oh, good. You do keep GPS logs on all your drivers.

266
00:09:20,280 --> 00:09:21,050
逃不出去了
There's no way out.

267
00:09:21,460 --> 00:09:23,240
我先把你的名字记下来
Let me just write down your name.

268
00:09:23,400 --> 00:09:25,600
谁还需要这张反面唱片店的收据吗
Hey, does anybody need a receipt from Flipside Records?

269
00:09:27,540 --> 00:09:28,220
去他的
Damn it!

270
00:09:28,260 --> 00:09:29,440
我连这个都没看见
I didn't even see that!

271
00:09:32,660 --> 00:09:34,160
我看到你报名了今晚的表演
I see you're registered for tonight's show.

272
00:09:34,300 --> 00:09:35,360
第一个上场是吧
First one, huh?

273
00:09:35,480 --> 00:09:35,920
是的
Yeah.

274
00:09:36,480 --> 00:09:38,420
大庭广众之下
I'm not sure I'm comfortable

275
00:09:38,420 --> 00:09:40,660
在一个圈里蹦蹦跳跳这种事
with that whole prancing-in-a-circle thing

276
00:09:40,660 --> 00:09:41,400
我觉得不太舒服
in front of everybody.

277
00:09:41,400 --> 00:09:43,528
能找别人带她完成表演吗
Can someone else run her through her routine?

278
00:09:43,540 --> 00:09:44,440
必须是主人亲自带
It has to be the owner.

279
00:09:44,560 --> 00:09:46,360
我想这是最好的 我俩有默契
I suppose that's the best. We have a rapport.

280
00:09:46,738 --> 00:09:48,125
好的 五点见
All right. See you at 5:00.

281
00:09:48,912 --> 00:09:51,055
我五点时家里有点儿事情
Uh, I got a family thing at 5:00.

282
00:09:51,580 --> 00:09:53,300
这种活动一般会准时开始吗
Do these things tend to start on time?

283
00:09:53,440 --> 00:09:55,380
当然了 这又不是猫咪表演
Of course. It's not a cat show.

284
00:09:56,278 --> 00:09:58,364
好吧 我最好快去快回 走吧
Well, I better speed it along. Come on.

285
00:09:59,420 --> 00:10:01,260
我真不敢相信妈妈让我带你来这里
I can't believe mom made me take you here.

286
00:10:01,420 --> 00:10:02,400
这是我唯一的一件黑色衬衫
This is my only black shirt,

287
00:10:02,400 --> 00:10:03,700
妈妈让我洗干净
and mom needs me to wash it.

288
00:10:04,660 --> 00:10:06,000
只有当我看到穷人时
It's only when I see the less fortunate

289
00:10:06,000 --> 00:10:07,940
我才意识到我的衣服有多幸运
that I realize how lucky my clothes are.

290
00:10:08,180 --> 00:10:10,300
洗衣机都被占用了 我们只能等着了
All the machines are taken. We're gonna have to wait.

291
00:10:10,500 --> 00:10:12,280
我才不要在这无聊的日光灯下
Oh, I am not spending any more time

292
00:10:12,280 --> 00:10:13,580
浪费更多时间
in fluorescent lighting than I have to.

293
00:10:13,640 --> 00:10:15,260
去把你的衬衫塞到别人的衣服里
You're gonna sneak your shirt in with someone else's load --

294
00:10:15,335 --> 00:10:16,745
比如那个男的 走这边
Like that guy's. Go that way.

295
00:10:16,760 --> 00:10:17,800
我去分散他的注意力
I'll distract him.

296
00:10:19,320 --> 00:10:20,040
不好意思
Excuse me.

297
00:10:21,420 --> 00:10:21,780
海莉
Haley?

298
00:10:21,960 --> 00:10:23,040
我的天 凯文
Oh, my god. Kevin.

299
00:10:23,320 --> 00:10:23,860
我的名字是基思
It's "Keith."

300
00:10:24,060 --> 00:10:25,380
你真的不记得
You really don't remember

301
00:10:25,380 --> 00:10:26,660
你在科切拉音乐节上抛弃的男生了吗
the guy you abandoned at Coachella?

302
00:10:26,819 --> 00:10:29,742
我没抛弃你 我给你发信息了
I didn't abandon you. I-I texted you.

303
00:10:29,742 --> 00:10:31,378
那个DJ简直把我催眠了
That deejay put me in a trance.

304
00:10:31,378 --> 00:10:32,760
是嘛 有点儿像是
Yeah. It's -- it's almost

305
00:10:32,760 --> 00:10:34,160
你为了要门票而利用我
like you were using me for tickets.

306
00:10:34,520 --> 00:10:36,340
怎么可能
Oh. That's crazy.

307
00:10:37,400 --> 00:10:38,580
你还能再弄到那个票吗
Can you get those again?

308
00:10:38,580 --> 00:10:40,840
还是你叔叔只能帮那一次忙
Or was that just, like, a one-time thing with your uncle?

309
00:10:41,320 --> 00:10:42,420
只有那一次
It was a one-time thing.

310
00:10:43,480 --> 00:10:44,880
好吧 那么 很高兴见到你
Okay, so, good seeing you.

311
00:10:45,260 --> 00:10:45,700
好吧
Yeah.

312
00:10:45,960 --> 00:10:48,040
-提醒我千万别跟你约会 -想得美
- Remind me never to date you. - You wish.

313
00:10:48,200 --> 00:10:49,640
拜托 我肯定能追到你
Please. I could totally get you.

314
00:10:49,940 --> 00:10:50,720
我倒想看你试试呢
Like to see you try.

315
00:10:51,440 --> 00:10:53,540
好了 莉莉 你能过来吗
All right, Lily, can you come in here, please?

316
00:10:55,420 --> 00:10:56,900
已经到圣诞节了吗
It's Christmas already?

317
00:10:58,800 --> 00:10:59,560
也许应该提前跟她说一声的
Probably should have prepped her.

318
00:10:59,640 --> 00:11:01,160
行了 不 这不是真正的圣诞节
Okay, no, it's not actually Christmas.

319
00:11:01,200 --> 00:11:03,000
我们只要拍一张好玩的照片
We're just gonna take a fun photo.

320
00:11:03,140 --> 00:11:05,220
而且我得在照片里因为我属于这个...
Which I am going to be in because I am a member of the --

321
00:11:05,220 --> 00:11:06,120
我的长筒袜呢
Where is my stocking?

322
00:11:06,120 --> 00:11:06,860
淡定
Oh, relax.

323
00:11:06,872 --> 00:11:08,268
它不在照片里 你也不在
It's not in the shot, and neither are you.

324
00:11:08,280 --> 00:11:10,000
拿着 你在这里拍这张照片
Here -- I want you to take the picture from right over here.

325
00:11:10,000 --> 00:11:11,280
这边 行 很好
This way. Okay, great.

326
00:11:11,280 --> 00:11:13,120
莉莉 你去换上这身衣服
Lily, I want you to put this on

327
00:11:13,120 --> 00:11:15,320
然后站在树前面 我们把照片一次搞定
and then stand in front of the tree, and we'll pop a shot off.

328
00:11:15,640 --> 00:11:17,500
快看这些漂亮的礼物
Ooh! Look at all the pretty presents!

329
00:11:17,580 --> 00:11:18,680
那些都是空盒子
Those are just empty boxes.

330
00:11:19,160 --> 00:11:20,620
你要气死我了
You're killing me!

331
00:11:22,260 --> 00:11:23,700
我不知道是哪一个
I don't know which one it is!

332
00:11:23,780 --> 00:11:25,100
我没看见他放衣服进去
I didn't see him put it in!

333
00:11:25,460 --> 00:11:27,100
等等 我想我找到了
Wait! I think I found it.

334
00:11:27,960 --> 00:11:28,660
他来了
He's coming!

335
00:11:28,980 --> 00:11:29,900
什么 不
What?! No!

336
00:11:30,220 --> 00:11:31,240
你在干什么
What are you doing?

337
00:11:31,240 --> 00:11:33,400
我 我看见你的衣服洗好了
Uh, I-I saw that your laundry was done,

338
00:11:33,400 --> 00:11:36,420
我想帮你叠好 这样我们就能把
and I was gonna fold it for you to make us even

339
00:11:36,420 --> 00:11:38,700
你觉得我做了但其实我没做的事情扯平了
for what you thought that I did that I didn't do.

340
00:11:39,020 --> 00:11:39,360
扯平
Even?

341
00:11:39,940 --> 00:11:41,400
我拿着你的爆米花
I held your popcorn for eight hours

342
00:11:41,400 --> 00:11:42,340
等了你八个小时
waiting for you to come back.

343
00:11:42,880 --> 00:11:44,320
我把整个停车场转了两遍
I walked all the parking areas twice,

344
00:11:44,320 --> 00:11:45,600
查看了所有的医用帐篷
checked every medical tent.

345
00:11:45,760 --> 00:11:46,920
等我回来的时候
By the time I got back to my car,

346
00:11:46,920 --> 00:11:49,080
我的车被砸了 电池被偷走
it had been broken into and the battery was gone.

347
00:11:49,800 --> 00:11:50,680
我不得不用我的音乐节门票
I had to trade my festival pass

348
00:11:50,691 --> 00:11:52,405
换一辆马拖车送我回家
for a ride home in a horse trailer.

349
00:11:53,400 --> 00:11:53,800
可是
But...

350
00:11:53,800 --> 00:11:56,400
看来某人拿到音乐会的纪念衫啦
Looks like someone got a concert t-shirt.

351
00:11:58,520 --> 00:11:59,720
爸爸 有什么事情让你烦心
Dad, is there anything bothering you

352
00:11:59,720 --> 00:12:02,080
导致你 也许是
that might be causing -- I don't know --

353
00:12:02,340 --> 00:12:03,420
严重的心理压力吗
major psychological stress?

354
00:12:03,660 --> 00:12:05,940
没有 我一直表现得很正常 不是吗
No. I've been acting normally, haven't I?

355
00:12:06,080 --> 00:12:07,580
今天早些时候发生什么了吗
Did something happen earlier today?

356
00:12:08,060 --> 00:12:09,180
什么都没有
Uh, nothing at all.

357
00:12:09,420 --> 00:12:10,720
因为你看上去有点儿紧张
Because you seem a little tense.

358
00:12:10,800 --> 00:12:12,240
什么 不 我没有 不要纠缠我
What? No, I don't! Stop badgering me!

359
00:12:12,240 --> 00:12:13,780
我爱你妈妈 我们听音乐吧
I love your mom! Let's listen to some music.

360
00:12:14,228 --> 00:12:16,020
天啊 你有时候编故事的方式
Boy, the way you cook things up sometimes,

361
00:12:16,020 --> 00:12:16,400
有点儿...
it's a little --

362
00:12:16,760 --> 00:12:17,680
-爸 -什么
- Dad! - What?!

363
00:12:18,200 --> 00:12:19,160
你睡着了
You fell asleep!

364
00:12:19,260 --> 00:12:20,560
已经是今天第五次了
It's like the fifth time today.

365
00:12:20,640 --> 00:12:21,880
我觉得这跟没来修洗衣机的
I think it has something to do with that guy

366
00:12:21,880 --> 00:12:23,260
那个人有关
not showing up to fix the washing machine.

367
00:12:23,300 --> 00:12:24,820
事情不完全是这样的
Well, that's not exactly what happened.

368
00:12:25,260 --> 00:12:26,220
你溜出去在反面唱片店
You snuck out to buy

369
00:12:26,220 --> 00:12:27,800
买《没人做得更好》这首歌时
"Nobody Does It Better" from Flipside Records,

370
00:12:27,800 --> 00:12:28,400
他来了是吗
and he showed up?

371
00:12:28,680 --> 00:12:30,180
差不多是这样了
That's more exactly what happened.

372
00:12:30,220 --> 00:12:31,040
你是怎么知道这些的
How do you know all this?

373
00:12:31,120 --> 00:12:32,420
我观察你一整天了
I've been watching you all day.

374
00:12:32,840 --> 00:12:35,060
我觉得由此产生的愧疚感让你昏昏欲睡
I think the guilt from that has been causing you to fall asleep.

375
00:12:35,260 --> 00:12:36,140
那你知道卡拉的事了?
So you know about Carla?

376
00:12:36,540 --> 00:12:37,400
现在知道了
I do now.

377
00:12:38,860 --> 00:12:40,480
-爸爸 -到底怎么回事啊
- Dad! - What is happening?!

378
00:12:42,486 --> 00:12:46,800
我原本还对穿牛仔裤和T恤衫表示怀疑
I was skeptical about the jeans and t-shirt,

379
00:12:46,800 --> 00:12:47,820
但我挺喜欢的
but I like it.

380
00:12:48,000 --> 00:12:50,400
摄影师能给我单独照几张吗
Any chance the photographer could fire off a couple solo shots?

381
00:12:51,300 --> 00:12:53,240
看看乔的下半边脸
Look at the bottom of Joe's face.

382
00:12:53,420 --> 00:12:55,080
怎么回事 你把他留在太阳下面了吗
What happened? Did you leave him in the sun?

383
00:12:55,260 --> 00:12:56,960
没有 我带他出去呆了五分钟
No, I took him out for five minutes

384
00:12:56,960 --> 00:12:58,320
好让他脸上有点颜色
to give him a little color.

385
00:12:58,740 --> 00:13:02,000
我肯定忘了把遮阳罩全部放下来了
I must have not closed the visor all the way down.

386
00:13:02,120 --> 00:13:03,800
他的肤色对你来说那么重要吗
Why is it so important to you that he has color?

387
00:13:03,980 --> 00:13:05,240
因为我们要把照片
Because we're sending this picture

388
00:13:05,240 --> 00:13:06,320
寄给哥伦比亚的家人
to our family in Colombia,

389
00:13:06,320 --> 00:13:09,120
但我有个完全不像哥伦比亚人的儿子
and I have a son that doesn't even look Colombian.

390
00:13:09,120 --> 00:13:10,460
到时候他们看到照片
Now they're gonna look at this picture,

391
00:13:10,460 --> 00:13:12,940
肯定会觉得我这个当妈的不称职
and they're gonna think that I am a terrible mother,

392
00:13:12,940 --> 00:13:15,120
居然连自己的小孩都照顾不好
that I can't even take care of my own child.

393
00:13:15,180 --> 00:13:16,740
你的名声早就臭了
I think your reputation is set.

394
00:13:16,960 --> 00:13:18,240
我现在还能做这个动作
I can still do this with my arm

395
00:13:18,249 --> 00:13:20,029
因为我在水池里一直睡到三岁
'cause I slept in the sink till I was 3.

396
00:13:20,174 --> 00:13:20,855
你好
Ha-lo!

397
00:13:21,200 --> 00:13:22,740
人已经来了 我来照顾乔
People are here. I'll deal with Joe.

398
00:13:22,880 --> 00:13:23,840
-好吧 -来吧 小宝贝
- Okay. - Come on, buddy.

399
00:13:24,632 --> 00:13:26,650
起来咯
Ohh. Come on.

400
00:13:26,650 --> 00:13:28,583
好啊 克莱尔还在路上
Hola. Claire is on her way.

401
00:13:28,900 --> 00:13:30,340
爸 你得向妈妈坦白
Dad, you have to confess to mom.

402
00:13:30,760 --> 00:13:32,680
消除愧疚感是唯一能解救你的办法
Clearing your conscience is the only way to make this stop.

403
00:13:32,780 --> 00:13:33,100
真的吗
Really?

404
00:13:33,860 --> 00:13:36,040
希望如此 不然我就得重写论文结论了
I hope so, or else I have to rewrite the whole end of my paper.

405
00:13:36,220 --> 00:13:38,040
怎么只有你们俩 其他人呢
Just the two of you? Where's the rest?

406
00:13:38,040 --> 00:13:40,640
我还想着五点前把照片的事解决掉呢
I had hoped to get this picture thing wrapped up by 5:00!

407
00:13:40,640 --> 00:13:41,620
他们会各自过来
They're all coming separately.

408
00:13:41,860 --> 00:13:44,080
小卡 帮个忙 打电话催一下米奇尔
Cam, do me a favor -- call Mitchell and light a fire under him.

409
00:13:44,200 --> 00:13:44,960
我就在这儿呢 爸
I'm right here, dad.

410
00:13:45,520 --> 00:13:47,100
好吧 我没看到你进来
Oh. Good. I didn't see you come in.

411
00:13:47,360 --> 00:13:48,740
是你帮我开的门
You opened the door for me.

412
00:13:48,800 --> 00:13:50,540
你还感谢我带了瓶雪当利酒过来
You thanked me for bringing a bottle of Chardonnay.

413
00:13:50,740 --> 00:13:51,640
听起来不像我
Doesn't sound like me.

414
00:13:52,900 --> 00:13:53,920
各位 我们到了
Hey, guys. We're here.

415
00:13:54,040 --> 00:13:55,240
终于来了 快开始吧
Finally. Let's do this.

416
00:13:55,240 --> 00:13:56,280
卢克你的黑T恤呢
Luke, where's your black shirt?

417
00:13:56,340 --> 00:13:57,500
就在这儿 我去换上
Right here. I'll get changed.

418
00:13:57,660 --> 00:13:58,700
好吧 快一点
All right. Shake a leg.

419
00:13:58,940 --> 00:14:00,300
-你好 亲爱的 -你好
- Hey, sweetie. - Hi!

420
00:14:02,140 --> 00:14:03,080
莉莉 小心点
Hey, Lily, be careful.

421
00:14:03,160 --> 00:14:05,220
别弄脏了这么漂亮的衣服
Don't get anything on that beautiful outfit.

422
00:14:05,580 --> 00:14:06,700
看到没有 是不是很眼熟
Recognize it? Look familiar?

423
00:14:07,120 --> 00:14:08,480
我看到了 但我不觉得
Yes, I do, but I hardly think

424
00:14:08,480 --> 00:14:10,420
你们在我发完火之后再给她穿
that putting her in one of Alex's hand-me-downs

425
00:14:10,420 --> 00:14:11,980
艾丽克斯的旧衣服能证明什么
proves anything after I pitched a fit.

426
00:14:12,160 --> 00:14:13,720
首先 我认为你敢于承认
Well, first of all, I think it's really healthy

427
00:14:13,720 --> 00:14:15,600
自己发了火真的很不错
that you do admit it was a fit.

428
00:14:15,920 --> 00:14:17,100
但如果你还需要别的证明
But if you need further proof,

429
00:14:17,160 --> 00:14:19,200
我肯定还能找到照片
I'm sure I could find a photograph over here.

430
00:14:19,300 --> 00:14:20,140
没问题 找吧
Sure. Go ahead.

431
00:14:20,500 --> 00:14:20,860
没我
No me.

432
00:14:21,220 --> 00:14:21,880
没我
No me.

433
00:14:22,420 --> 00:14:23,060
没我
No me.

434
00:14:23,320 --> 00:14:26,300
找到了 去年圣诞节早上
Ah. There we are.Christmas morning last year.

435
00:14:26,420 --> 00:14:27,440
天啊
Oh, my god.

436
00:14:27,540 --> 00:14:29,940
是艾丽克斯的旧睡衣
Oh, it's Alex's old pajamas!

437
00:14:30,440 --> 00:14:32,440
对不起 我该向你道歉
I'm so sorry. I owe you an apology.

438
00:14:32,580 --> 00:14:34,180
有些时候我可能太
Sometimes I can be really --

439
00:14:34,180 --> 00:14:35,220
那是什么
What's that?

440
00:14:35,360 --> 00:14:37,206
挂历是十二月
Uh, the calendar opened to december,

441
00:14:37,560 --> 00:14:39,300
给圣诞老人的饼干被吃了一半
the half-eaten cookies for Santa Claus,

442
00:14:39,420 --> 00:14:41,640
给驯鹿的胡萝卜被啃过 哪里有问题
the nibbled-on carrots for reindeer? I don't know.

443
00:14:42,000 --> 00:14:45,240
那不是上个月的《名利场》杂志吗
No, that looks like last month's Vanity Fair.

444
00:14:45,420 --> 00:14:47,180
好莱坞的造型不就那么几种
Oh, well, you know, every month's "Young hollywood."

445
00:14:47,180 --> 00:14:49,610
莉莉那颗牙不是刚掉的吗
Mm, and didn't Lily just lose that tooth?

446
00:14:49,621 --> 00:14:51,123
不 牙还在 就是弄脏了
Nope, it's still there. It's just dirty.

447
00:14:51,123 --> 00:14:52,360
圣诞节早晨吃的巧克力
Christmas-morning chocolates.

448
00:14:52,360 --> 00:14:54,780
我很确定这个是米奇尔
Uh, and I am quite sure that's a reflection of Mitchell

449
00:14:54,780 --> 00:14:57,040
穿着今早那套衣服的身影
in the clothes he was wearing this morning.

450
00:14:57,160 --> 00:14:58,960
我终于出现在照片里了
Oh, yay, I finally made it into a picture.

451
00:14:59,060 --> 00:15:00,000
你真是本性难移啊 是吧
Just couldn't change, could you?

452
00:15:00,140 --> 00:15:01,200
你是个势利眼
You are a snob.

453
00:15:01,200 --> 00:15:02,180
-你知道吗 -你是个势利眼
- Okay, you know what... - You're a snob.

454
00:15:02,180 --> 00:15:03,800
就算不是势利眼也看得出
...it hardly takes a snob to recognize

455
00:15:03,811 --> 00:15:05,340
-你给你的孩子们买的衣服 -势利眼
- the clothes you put your children in... - Snob!

456
00:15:05,340 --> 00:15:06,153
顶多也就称得上普通
are uninspired at best.

457
00:15:06,153 --> 00:15:08,906
-克莱尔 小卡 够了 -真的吗
- Claire,Cam, enough! - Oh, really?!

458
00:15:08,980 --> 00:15:10,320
这家里每个人的品味都很棒
Everybody in this family has good taste.

459
00:15:10,380 --> 00:15:11,240
只不过各不相同
It's just different.

460
00:15:11,440 --> 00:15:13,080
这已经引发了太多争执
It's causing too many fights.

461
00:15:13,440 --> 00:15:15,320
所以我今天才要求
That's why today I just put everybody

462
00:15:15,320 --> 00:15:17,680
大家都穿简单的T恤和牛仔裤
in a simple T-shirt-and-jeans outfit.

463
00:15:18,020 --> 00:15:19,848
现在开始定一条新家规
Mm. There's a new rule from now on --

464
00:15:19,900 --> 00:15:22,000
谁也不能再给别人的小孩衣服
nobody gives clothes to anyone else's children.

465
00:15:22,040 --> 00:15:23,700
我觉得这是最好的解决方案
Well, I think that's probably for the best.

466
00:15:24,380 --> 00:15:27,120
感谢上帝乔这次生日我不用
Thank god I don't have to spend one more of Joe's birthdays

467
00:15:27,360 --> 00:15:29,340
再那样尴尬地笑了
with a funny smile on my face.

468
00:15:29,920 --> 00:15:31,980
谢谢你小卡 他很喜欢
Thank you, Cam. He loves it.

469
00:15:32,780 --> 00:15:33,180
双胞胎哟
Twinsies!

470
00:15:36,640 --> 00:15:38,240
好了 各位 要照相了
Okay, everybody, it's picture time.

471
00:15:38,800 --> 00:15:39,420
卢克呢
Where's Luke?

472
00:15:39,660 --> 00:15:40,340
在这儿呢
Right here.

473
00:15:40,760 --> 00:15:42,980
宝贝 你穿的是什么 女生的T恤吗
Honey, what are you wearing? Is that a girl's shirt?

474
00:15:43,160 --> 00:15:44,840
我貌似在洗衣房拿错了
I guess I grabbed the wrong one from the laundromat.

475
00:15:45,280 --> 00:15:47,300
不过坦白讲我不讨厌这种贴身感
If I'm being honest, I don't hate the way it fits.

476
00:15:47,310 --> 00:15:49,884
肯定是那家伙的女友的衣服
It must be that guy's girlfriend's shirt.

477
00:15:50,380 --> 00:15:51,840
要是我说这样让对他更有兴趣了
Is it bad that that makes him

478
00:15:51,840 --> 00:15:52,760
是不是不太好
more interesting to me?

479
00:15:52,880 --> 00:15:53,820
是的 离他远点
Yes. Stay away.

480
00:15:53,980 --> 00:15:55,720
不用担心卢克 我们可以让他站到后排
Don't worry about Luke. We'll stick him in the back row.

481
00:15:55,820 --> 00:15:57,840
不是所有人都能被拍得好看的
Not everyone can look their best in the picture.

482
00:15:58,160 --> 00:15:59,020
乔准备好了
Joe's ready.

483
00:16:00,720 --> 00:16:01,780
你对他做了什么
What did you do to him?

484
00:16:02,020 --> 00:16:03,480
你想让他看起来更像哥伦比亚人
You want him to look more Colombian.

485
00:16:03,640 --> 00:16:05,640
没有比哥伦比亚国旗更合适的了
What's more Colombian than the Colombian flag?

486
00:16:05,820 --> 00:16:06,700
太完美了
He's perfect.

487
00:16:06,900 --> 00:16:08,600
今天对我的儿子们来说不是个好日子
Not a banner day for my male heirs.

488
00:16:09,260 --> 00:16:10,640
克莱尔 你站到后面去
Claire, you're in the back.

489
00:16:10,980 --> 00:16:13,260
菲尔 你站克莱尔后面 别乱比手势
Phil, you're behind Claire. No rabbit ears.

490
00:16:13,500 --> 00:16:15,480
我不希望你在克莱尔背后玩什么花样
I don't want you messing around behind Claire's back.

491
00:16:16,560 --> 00:16:18,120
卡梅隆 莉莉 快来
Cameron, Lily, come on in.

492
00:16:18,120 --> 00:16:18,820
要照相了
It's picture time.

493
00:16:19,180 --> 00:16:19,500
亲爱的
Honey.

494
00:16:20,040 --> 00:16:21,660
我有点事想跟你说
There's something I need to tell you.

495
00:16:21,660 --> 00:16:24,040
你知道人都会有一些
Uh, you know how you can treasure

496
00:16:24,040 --> 00:16:25,360
想要珍惜的过去
special moments in your past

497
00:16:25,360 --> 00:16:27,900
但绝不会因此影响现在的幸福
that in no way diminish the special moments in your present?

498
00:16:27,912 --> 00:16:29,880
没错 亲爱的 那叫做回忆
Yeah, sweetheart, it's called having a memory.

499
00:16:29,880 --> 00:16:31,960
希望我坦白的时候你态度能好一点
Okay, I wouldn't mind a friendlier tone as I move through this.

500
00:16:32,060 --> 00:16:32,720
你做了什么
What did you do?

501
00:16:32,752 --> 00:16:33,774
快 快 快
Up, up, up, up, ah!

502
00:16:33,774 --> 00:16:35,503
走错方向了 宝贝
No, that's the wrong way, sweetheart.

503
00:16:35,640 --> 00:16:36,940
莉莉的口袋里掉了什么出来
What fell out of Lily's pocket?

504
00:16:37,900 --> 00:16:39,160
那是钻戒吗
Is that a diamond ring?

505
00:16:39,160 --> 00:16:40,980
跟你的T恤肯定很配
Huh. That'll go great with your shirt.

506
00:16:40,980 --> 00:16:41,880
看上去是真的
It looks real.

507
00:16:42,860 --> 00:16:43,800
是真的
It is real.

508
00:16:44,360 --> 00:16:47,100
有点小瑕疵但是颜色很正
A small occlusion, but very good color.

509
00:16:47,480 --> 00:16:48,300
是克莱尔的
This is Claire's.

510
00:16:48,480 --> 00:16:48,920
不是
No.

511
00:16:49,167 --> 00:16:50,474
克莱尔的戴在她手上呢
Claire's got her's on.

512
00:16:50,474 --> 00:16:52,197
菲尔 得了吧 你完全无法区分
Ay, Phil, please, you cannot tell the difference

513
00:16:52,197 --> 00:16:55,820
这颗美丽但有点小的钻石
between this beautiful, but a small, diamond

514
00:16:55,820 --> 00:16:57,880
和那一大块的玻璃仿制品
and that chunk of glass

515
00:16:57,880 --> 00:17:00,280
那玩意儿几周前就该把她的手指勒断了
that should have made her finger fall off weeks ago.

516
00:17:01,360 --> 00:17:04,100
我感觉我好像给你惹祸上身了
I feel like I am getting you in trouble.

517
00:17:05,040 --> 00:17:06,020
拍照啦
Picture time!

518
00:17:06,280 --> 00:17:06,920
怎么回事
What's happening?

519
00:17:07,940 --> 00:17:09,220
好吧 你先别生气
Okay, don't be mad.

520
00:17:09,560 --> 00:17:12,260
我几个月前把我的真戒指弄丢了
Um, I lost my real ring a few months ago,

521
00:17:12,260 --> 00:17:13,640
我刚刚才意识到那肯定是掉进了
and I just realized it must have fallen

522
00:17:13,640 --> 00:17:15,420
我送给莉莉的那一箱衣服里
in the box of clothes I gave to Lily.

523
00:17:15,640 --> 00:17:16,560
你为什么要把戒指取下来
Why'd you take it off?

524
00:17:17,240 --> 00:17:19,360
我开车被警察拦下了
Well, I got pulled over,

525
00:17:19,360 --> 00:17:22,260
我想跟他调调情 让他免开罚单
and I wanted to flirt my way out of the ticket

526
00:17:22,260 --> 00:17:23,800
于是假装我是单身
by pretending I was single

527
00:17:23,800 --> 00:17:26,500
那方法起作用了 我还挺喜欢的
And it worked, and I kind of liked it.

528
00:17:26,500 --> 00:17:28,400
然后我对这种喜欢产生了深深的愧疚感
And then I felt so guilty about liking it

529
00:17:28,400 --> 00:17:30,540
于是我想把这全部的记忆都抹除掉
that I just wanted to erase the whole thing.

530
00:17:30,660 --> 00:17:31,340
所以你撒谎了吗
So you lied?

531
00:17:31,940 --> 00:17:33,720
是的 我撒谎了 我很抱歉
Yes. I lied. I'm sorry.

532
00:17:33,840 --> 00:17:35,500
那是不是说明我是个很糟糕的人
Does that make me a terrible person?

533
00:17:35,620 --> 00:17:38,380
不 不会 你在开玩笑吗
No, no. Are you kidding me?

534
00:17:38,880 --> 00:17:40,560
我们已经结婚很久了
We've been married for a long time.

535
00:17:40,570 --> 00:17:42,681
我们各自都有点小秘密也是很自然的嘛
Of course we're gonna have our little secrets.

536
00:17:42,780 --> 00:17:43,980
重要的是
The important thing...

537
00:17:43,980 --> 00:17:45,500
我们心里很清楚
...is that we know the difference

538
00:17:45,500 --> 00:17:47,000
无害的放纵
between a harmless indulgence...

539
00:17:47,000 --> 00:17:48,560
和真正放荡的区别
and a real indiscreet--

540
00:17:51,180 --> 00:17:51,660
歌洛莉亚
Gloria?

541
00:17:53,040 --> 00:17:54,180
-左边那枚 -谢谢
- Left. - Thank you.

542
00:17:54,520 --> 00:17:55,960
好了 该拍照了
Okay, it's picture time!

543
00:17:55,960 --> 00:17:56,981
大家都快点
Everybody, hury up.

544
00:17:57,100 --> 00:17:58,080
赶快就位
Get in your positions.

545
00:17:58,400 --> 00:17:59,693
都好了吗
All right?

546
00:17:59,693 --> 00:18:02,080
很好 大家应该都到齐了
All right, I think that everyone is here.

547
00:18:02,080 --> 00:18:03,080
准备好了吗
Okay, ready?

548
00:18:03,080 --> 00:18:03,720
笑一个
And smile!

549
00:18:04,840 --> 00:18:05,940
开什么玩笑啊
Are you kidding me?

550
00:18:06,320 --> 00:18:07,780
没有一个人注意到我不在
Nobody noticed I wasn't here.

551
00:18:07,820 --> 00:18:09,360
你们是怎么回事啊
What does it take with you people?!

552
00:18:10,130 --> 00:18:12,979
乔 我的宝贝 你还好吧
Ay, Joe, my baby, are you okay?

553
00:18:12,979 --> 00:18:14,560
好吧 好吧 或许只有那样
Yeah, yeah, maybe -- maybe that -- that's what it takes

554
00:18:14,560 --> 00:18:15,800
你们才会注意到我
for you to pay attention to me --

555
00:18:15,800 --> 00:18:17,440
像乔一样发一下脾气
Throw a temper tantrum like -- like Joe.

556
00:18:17,440 --> 00:18:20,680
我也可以大发 雷霆
I could just throw a big...temper tantrum that --

557
00:18:20,805 --> 00:18:22,909
把一切都弄得一团糟
Or if I make a mess of everything and...

558
00:18:32,180 --> 00:18:34,200
我觉得你刚刚的火是冲着我发的
I feel like that was aimed at me.

559
00:18:35,340 --> 00:18:36,440
你想谈谈这事吗
You want to talk about it?

560
00:18:36,440 --> 00:18:38,080
不如我去弹弹钢琴消消火吧
Or I could just play some piano.

561
00:18:38,080 --> 00:18:39,120
看来被我猜中了
So I'm in the ballpark.

562
00:18:41,000 --> 00:18:41,500
听着
Look.

563
00:18:42,560 --> 00:18:46,220
如果你有时候觉得我们没注意到你的存在
If it seems sometimes like we don't notice you,

564
00:18:46,220 --> 00:18:48,680
那或许是因为我们正集中心思
maybe that is because we are focused...

565
00:18:48,680 --> 00:18:50,600
处理我们各自愚蠢的问题
...on our own stupid problems,

566
00:18:51,580 --> 00:18:52,920
你这人向来很稳重
And you're so steady.

567
00:18:53,040 --> 00:18:53,920
你是说我很无趣吧
Oh, you mean boring.

568
00:18:53,920 --> 00:18:55,040
-不是的 -就是的
- No. - Yeah.

569
00:18:55,120 --> 00:18:55,620
冷静
Calm.

570
00:18:56,480 --> 00:18:57,520
因为你是按照你想要的方式
Because you live your life

571
00:18:57,520 --> 00:18:59,720
在过自己的生活
the way you want to.

572
00:19:00,760 --> 00:19:02,780
实际上 你最近也激励了我
In fact, you inspired me recently.

573
00:19:02,780 --> 00:19:03,519
怎么说
Oh, how so?

574
00:19:06,980 --> 00:19:07,480
好吧
Fine.

575
00:19:09,260 --> 00:19:10,880
我最近经历了一些事
I've been going through this thing lately.

576
00:19:10,880 --> 00:19:12,060
一切都开始于我注意到
It all started when I noticed

577
00:19:12,060 --> 00:19:15,060
有一群男人喜欢聚在公园的角落里
a group of guys in the corner in the park.

578
00:19:15,660 --> 00:19:18,200
老实说 我最开始知晓他们在做什么时
And, uh, honestly, when I first found out what they were doing,

579
00:19:18,220 --> 00:19:19,260
我觉得那很怪
I thought it was kind of weird,

580
00:19:19,260 --> 00:19:21,280
但后来我发现我不停想着这事
but I found I kept thinking about it.

581
00:19:22,480 --> 00:19:23,960
我觉得我该去尝试一下
And I thought I'd give it a whirl.

582
00:19:24,301 --> 00:19:25,600
好吧 继续
Ok-- okay. Go on.

583
00:19:25,600 --> 00:19:26,900
我觉得你应该能猜到接下来会怎样
I think you know where I'm going with this,

584
00:19:28,140 --> 00:19:29,760
但是其中一个比我年长的家伙领我进了圈
but one of the older guys showed me the ropes.

585
00:19:29,820 --> 00:19:30,920
不知不觉地
Next thing I know,

586
00:19:30,920 --> 00:19:34,100
我每天都会去那个公园的那个角落
I'm hanging out at that park in that corner every day

587
00:19:34,100 --> 00:19:34,940
并且很喜欢那种感觉
and loving it.

588
00:19:35,980 --> 00:19:38,920
但我一定对此感到有些羞耻
But I must have also got some shame about it

589
00:19:38,920 --> 00:19:39,820
因为我在做那事儿的时候
because it feels good

590
00:19:39,820 --> 00:19:41,060
真的感觉很爽 但是
when I'm doing it, but...

591
00:19:41,060 --> 00:19:43,040
那还是我吗
Is that me now?

592
00:19:43,937 --> 00:19:45,380
带狗表演的男人
A guy with a show dog.

593
00:19:45,380 --> 00:19:46,020
原来是这个啊
There it is!

594
00:19:46,225 --> 00:19:47,760
好吧 我知道你不是去公园搞基
Okay, see, I-I knew what it wasn't.

595
00:19:47,760 --> 00:19:48,860
我就是不知道你到底在干什么事儿
I just wasn't sure what it was.

596
00:19:49,040 --> 00:19:50,540
实际上 现在就有一场表演
In fact, there's a show right now,

597
00:19:50,540 --> 00:19:52,498
但是 我不去了
But...ah, I'm not gonna go.

598
00:19:52,498 --> 00:19:54,503
不 不 爸
No, no. D--

599
00:19:54,531 --> 00:19:56,640
-我可以看出来这事对你很重要 -不
- I could tell this is important to you. - No.

600
00:19:56,640 --> 00:19:58,120
你该去 你该去
You -- you should go. You should go.

601
00:19:58,180 --> 00:19:59,280
我不想偷溜出去
I don't want to sneak out,

602
00:19:59,300 --> 00:20:01,260
我也不想其他人知道这事儿
and I don't want people to know about it.

603
00:20:01,320 --> 00:20:01,740
爸
Dad.

604
00:20:02,820 --> 00:20:04,960
一个睿智的人曾经跟我说过
A wise man once told me,

605
00:20:05,600 --> 00:20:06,840
"我不理解这个
"I don't get it,

606
00:20:06,920 --> 00:20:08,620
但如果那就是真实的你
but if that's who you are,

607
00:20:08,660 --> 00:20:10,500
千万别为此觉得羞耻"
Don't you dare be ashamed of it."

608
00:20:13,920 --> 00:20:15,680
我当时对待那事的态度真是很好
I did handle that kind of well.

609
00:20:15,697 --> 00:20:17,040
是呀 是啦 好吧
Yeah, yeah, well...

610
00:20:17,040 --> 00:20:18,340
那对我来说可不易
And it wasn't easy.

611
00:20:20,000 --> 00:20:22,140
我从没想过我儿子会成为一名律师
I just never pictured my kid a lawyer.

612
00:20:23,940 --> 00:20:26,400
让人们见到真实的你是很可怕的一件事
It's scary to let people see the real you,

613
00:20:26,420 --> 00:20:28,420
即使是面对你最亲的家人亦是如此
even when those people are your own family.

614
00:20:29,240 --> 00:20:31,460
但其实我们最不该担心他们的态度
But aren't they the ones we should be least worried about,

615
00:20:32,260 --> 00:20:34,240
因为他们是不带偏见爱我们的人
the ones who will love us without judging,

616
00:20:34,440 --> 00:20:35,520
他们会原谅我们的过错
who forgive our faults

617
00:20:35,520 --> 00:20:37,000
庆祝我们的不完美
and celebrate our imperfections?

618
00:20:37,160 --> 00:20:38,560
甚至会鼓励我们
Maybe even encourage us

619
00:20:38,560 --> 00:20:40,120
尽情展现真实的自己
to let our true selves shine through?

620
00:20:40,120 --> 00:20:42,500
等等 稍等一下
Wait, wait. Hang on. Wait, wait.

621
00:20:43,840 --> 00:20:44,320
好了
Okay.

622
00:20:48,740 --> 00:20:49,800
我觉得你看上去好漂亮
I think you look beautiful.

623
00:20:50,140 --> 00:20:50,900
我看上去好老
I look old.

624
00:20:51,100 --> 00:20:52,940
我所有的表亲都会看到的
All my cousins are going to see this.

625
00:20:53,220 --> 00:20:55,700
点击一下那个按钮 把我的皱纹都修掉
Click the button that makes my wrinkles go away.

626
00:21:00,440 --> 00:21:02,060
-出什么事了 -没什么
- What happened? - Nothing.

627
00:21:02,520 --> 00:21:04,160
才不是没事呢 你都成跛子了
It's not nothing. You're limping!

628
00:21:04,820 --> 00:21:06,880
你是不是又尝试跳俄式舞蹈来着
Were you trying to do the Russian dance again?

629
00:21:06,880 --> 00:21:08,700
就是我在尝试的很愚蠢的举动
It was just something stupid I was trying out,

630
00:21:08,700 --> 00:21:10,080
我也不知道为什么这样
and I don't even know why,

631
00:21:10,080 --> 00:21:11,520
那几乎是不可能的
since it's basically impossible.

632
00:21:11,920 --> 00:21:13,700
歌洛莉亚 歌洛莉亚 快看
Gloria. Gloria! Check it out.

633
00:21:13,900 --> 00:21:15,480
这一定是你见过的最萌的事吧
Is this not the cutest thing you've ever seen?

634
00:21:15,840 --> 00:21:17,420
它第一次尝试就成功了
She did that on her first try.

635
00:21:17,800 --> 00:21:19,180
他也好喜欢
He loves it, too.

636
00:21:19,240 --> 00:21:21,140
算你狠 乔 继续戳我痛处吧
Oh, oh, sure. Rub it in, Joe.

637
00:21:21,140 --> 00:21:22,450
真棒
Attagirl!

638
00:21:22,450 --> 00:21:23,840
它往我这边来了
Here she comes this way!

639
00:21:23,840 --> 00:21:25,140
现在它就有点儿炫耀的意思了
Now she is just showing off.

640
00:21:25,610 --> 00:21:26,520
我也是的
Both way.
